    "post": "6a04a032a5420b5a0bce8653",
    "content": "Identify the type of each function: Determine whether each function in the integrand is inverse trigonometric, logarithmic, algebraic, trigonometric, or exponential.\n\nChoose the first function: Select the function that appears first in the ILATE order as the first function (u).\n\nSelect the second function: The remaining function will be the second function (dv).\n\nApply the integration by parts formula: Use the formula ∫u dv = uv - ∫v du to integrate the product of the two functions.",
